Revision history for Coin::Hnoss

0.010  2026-11-09
       - Documentation release: README, CONTRIBUTING, LICENSE, complete
         POD across all modules. No API changes.
       - Add META_MERGE provides metadata to Makefile.PL.

       - Currency repository:
         * Add BTC (Bitcoin, exponent 8 = satoshi), TRX (TRON, exponent
           6 = sun), and USDT (Tether USD, exponent 6, on both TRC20
           and ERC20) to the default repository as documented non-ISO
           extensions. Everything else in the table remains strictly
           ISO 4217 (or ISO 4217 historical / metatokens).
         * Relax Coin::Hnoss::Currency code validation from "exactly 3
           uppercase letters" to "3 to 8 ASCII letters", so longer
           non-ISO codes like USDT are accepted. Same relaxation in
           Currency::Repository->new. Error messages updated from
           "Invalid ISO 4217 currency code" to "Invalid currency code:
           must be 3-8 ASCII letters". All ISO 4217 codes still work
           unchanged.
         * Tests updated accordingly: USDD, USDX, USDT, WBTC, SHIB,
           AVAX are now valid; 9+ character codes and non-letter
           characters remain rejected.

0.009  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->from_string, parsing major-unit strings
         into minor-unit Money using the currency''s exponent. Strict
         about precision: too many decimal digits is an error, never a
         silent round. Options mirror format (decimal_mark,
         thousands_separator, group_size).

0.008  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->format, using the currency''s minor-unit
         exponent with configurable decimal mark, thousands separator,
         group size, currency inclusion, and currency separator.

0.007_01 2026-11-09
       - Fix Currency::Repository->default: replace invalid `state` with
         a file-scoped lexical.

0.007  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency::Repository with built-in ISO 4217
         exponents.
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency->exponent and ->subunit.

0.006_02 2026-11-09
       - Fix allocate: allocate on |amount| then negate, so that
         allocate(-x, ...) is the element-wise negation of
         allocate(x, ...).

0.006  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->allocate.

0.005  2026-11-09
       - Add comparison and predicates to Coin::Hnoss::Money:
         compare, is_zero, is_positive, is_negative, greater_than,
         greater_or_equal, less_than, less_or_equal.
       - Overload <=>, ==, !=, <, >, <=, >= to use compare.

0.004_01 2026-11-09
       - Document floor semantics for divide / divide_with_remainder
         (matching Math::BigInt::bdiv and Python''s divmod).

0.004  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Exception base class.
       - Add arithmetic to Coin::Hnoss::Money: add, subtract, multiply,
         divide, divide_with_remainder, negate, abs.

0.003  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money (immutable amount + currency value
         object).

0.002  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency (ISO 4217 code value object).

0.001  2026-11-09
       - Initial skeleton.
